    "name": "PayPilot AI - Core API Collection",
    "description": "Production-ready Postman collection for PayPilot AI. Covers health monitoring, AI-assisted business profile onboarding, dashboard metrics, commerce ledger, AI copilot decision support, and payment approval workflows.",
